{
  "an3.65:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.65 ",
  "an3.65:0.2": "7. Mahāvagga ",
  "an3.65:0.3": "Kesamuttisutta ",
  "an3.65:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "an3.65:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ yena kesamuttaṁ nāma kālāmānaṁ nigamo tadavasari. ",
  "an3.65:1.3": "Assosuṁ kho kesamuttiyā kālāmā: ",
  "an3.65:1.4": "“samaṇo khalu, bho, gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito kesamuttaṁ anuppatto. ",
  "an3.65:1.5": "Taṁ kho pana bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato: ",
  "an3.65:1.6": "‘itipi so bhagavā …pe… ",
  "an3.65:1.7": "sādhu kho pana tathārūpānaṁ arahataṁ dassanaṁ hotī’”ti. ",
  "an3.65:2.1": "Atha kho kesamuttiyā kālāmā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā appekacce bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu, appekacce bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodiṁsu, sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu, appekacce yena bhagavā tenañjaliṁ paṇāmetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu, appekacce nāmagottaṁ sāvetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu, appekacce tuṇhībhūtā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinnā kho te kesamuttiyā kālāmā bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ: ",
  "an3.65:3.1": "“Santi, bhante, eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā kesamuttaṁ āgacchanti. ",
  "an3.65:3.2": "Te sakaṁyeva vādaṁ dīpenti jotenti, parappavādaṁ pana khuṁsenti vambhenti paribhavanti omakkhiṁ karonti. ",
  "an3.65:3.3"